# Redtooth Genealogist {2}{G}, a 2/3 Elf Advisor: "When this creature enters, create a Royal Role token attached to another target creature you control." Bot1 has Memnite
# and Ornithopter, Bot2 an Ornithopter. The trigger refuses the Genealogist itself (CR 115.1, "another") and Bot2's creature ("you control"); targeting Memnite, the Role makes
# it 2/2 with ward {1} (CR 111.10m, 303.4). Ornithopter and the Genealogist are unchanged.

